### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "sample re",
  "email": "aashh@shajajaj.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "membershipTier": "Gold",
  "emergencyContact": "9999999922"
}

### Login (username or email)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "aashh@shajajaj.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Profile and remaining days
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/me

### Upcoming classes, filter by trainer
GET http://localhost:3000/api/classes?trainer=Maria

### Class details with enrolled members
GET http://localhost:3000/api/classes/PUT_CLASS_ID_HERE

### Create a class (admin)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Zumba Cardio",
  "trainerName": "Maria",
  "scheduleDate": "2030-04-15T09:00:00Z",
  "maxCapacity": 2
}

### Update a class (admin)
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/classes/PUT_CLASS_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maxCapacity": 5
}

### Delete a class (admin)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/classes/PUT_CLASS_ID_HERE

### Book a class
POST http://localhost:3000/api/classes/PUT_CLASS_ID_HERE/book

### Cancel a booking
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/classes/PUT_CLASS_ID_HERE/cancel

### My booked classes
GET http://localhost:3000/api/classes/mine

### Renew membership (own id, or any id as admin)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/members/PUT_USER_ID_HERE/renew
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "additionalMonths": 6,
  "tier": "Platinum"
}

### Expired members (admin)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/members/expired

### Logout
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/logout
